<section
  id="spectrum"
  class="section-band spectrum-band"
  aria-labelledby="spectrum-title"
  data-motion-group="spectrum"
>
  <div class="container section-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">A Developmental View</p>
    <h2 id="spectrum-title" class="section-heading">The Five-Stage Evolutionary Spectrum</h2>
    <p>
      The spectrum assesses evolutionary autonomy (EA), supervision autonomy (SA), and
      optimization scope and coordination (SC). Each stage builds on the requirements of
      earlier stages. A system is placed at the highest stage for which it has demonstrated
      all required capabilities under the stated deployment conditions.
    </p>
  </div>

  <figure class="wide-figure container-wide" data-motion-item data-motion-kind="figure">
