      <img
        src="/assets/images/figures/Spectrum-2.svg"
        alt="Five stages from human-engineered maintenance to recursive meta evolution, compared across evolutionary autonomy, supervision autonomy, and optimization scope and coordination."
        width="4954"
        height="2592"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </a>
    <figcaption>
      <strong>Figure 1.</strong> How the three dimensions develop across five stages of
      agent evolution.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <div class="representative-landscape-intro container" data-motion-item>
    <p class="eyebrow">Research Landscape</p>
    <h3>Representative Systems Across the Spectrum</h3>
    <p>
      The representative systems illustrate how adaptation changes across stages.
      MUSE is a prototype targeting Stage-4 capabilities.
    </p>
  </div>

  <figure
